|----------|------|------|
| `.flat(Infinity)` | Shortest, native, fast | Requires ES2019+ |
| Recursive | Easy to read and understand | Can overflow the stack on extremely deep nesting |
| Iterative | Handles any depth safely | Slightly more complex |

